  "sn10.12:0.3": "<p><i>This discourse, which also occurs at <a href='https://suttacentral.net/snp1.10'>Sn 1:10</a>, is the source of many proverbs frequently quoted in Theravadin countries. In 1982, when Thailand was celebrating the 200th anniversary of the founding of the current dynasty, His Majesty the King structured his chief address to the Thai people around the four qualities mentioned in the Buddha’s last verse.</i></p><p>See also: AN 3:48; <a href='https://suttacentral.net/an4.62'>AN 4:62</a>; <a href='https://suttacentral.net/an8.54'>AN 8:54</a>; <a href='https://suttacentral.net/dhp334-359#dhp354'>Dhp 354</a></p>",
